      "en": "About the eleventh hourhe went out and found others standing idle. He said to them, ‘Why do you stand here all day idle?’",
      "ko": "제 십일시에도 나가 보니 섰는 사람들이 또 있는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "d62f1b0afad4de17178001cc8707fb2642e882f82ce3f0cfd5d822b79e85d6cf",
