      "en": "“They said to him, ‘Because no one has hired us.’“He said to them, ‘You also go into the vineyard, and you will receive whatever is right.’",
      "ko": "가로되 너희는 어찌하여 종일토록 놀고 여기 섰느뇨 가로되 우리를 품군으로 쓰는이가 없음이니이다 가로되 너희도 포도원에 들어가라 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ec358179d03201077eec15817732a4e22f5b096208ca2eed7b76e8dffa2a6aca",
      "translation_text_hash": "a23a3accbcfaa3b7453f9eeac43970e8d2b6a51d0e0658c4c94f3ca9394e0a4c",
